# This branch is checked out directly as ~/.claude. Ignore everything the
# live config dir contains; publish only what is explicitly unignored.
# Sensitive live state (settings.json, history.jsonl, projects/ memory,
# sessions/) must never become trackable — add unignore rules narrowly.
*
!CLAUDE.md
!agents/
!agents/*.md
!.gitignore
!README.md
!hooks/
!hooks/pre-commit
